@startuml 端口适配器类图_采集
' 系统分析报告 3.2 端口与适配器类图（一）采集侧（PlantUML 类图）
' 渲染：java -jar plantuml.jar docs/uml/端口适配器类图_采集.puml -tpng -charset UTF-8
title 智能日报生成器 v2 · 采集端口与适配器

skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
hide circle
skinparam class {
  BackgroundColor #F7F9FC
  BorderColor #5A6B8C
}
skinparam interface {
  BackgroundColor #FFF6DA
  BorderColor #5A6B8C
}
skinparam ArrowColor #5A6B8C
left to right direction
skinparam nodesep 30
skinparam ranksep 35

class SourceBundle {
  commit_source : CommitSource
  task_source : TaskSource
  message_source : MessageSource
  attendance_source : AttendanceSource | None = None
}

interface CommitSource <<Protocol · runtime_checkable>> {
  collect_commits(owner, repo, since, until, *, max_pages=10) : list[CommitRecord]
}
interface TaskSource <<Protocol · runtime_checkable>> {
  collect_tasks(since, until) : list[TaskRecord]
}
interface MessageSource <<Protocol · runtime_checkable>> {
  collect_messages(since, until) : list[MessageRecord]
}
interface AttendanceSource <<Protocol · runtime_checkable>> {
  collect_attendance(since, until) : list[AttendanceRecord]
}

class GitHubCommitSource <<适配器>>
class MockCommitSource <<测试替身>>
class FeishuTaskSource <<适配器>>
class MockTaskSource <<测试替身>>
class FeishuMessageSource <<适配器>>
class MockMessageSource <<测试替身>>
class FeishuAttendanceSource <<适配器>>
class MockAttendanceSource <<测试替身>>

SourceBundle --> CommitSource : 调用
SourceBundle --> TaskSource : 调用
SourceBundle --> MessageSource : 调用
SourceBundle --> AttendanceSource : 可选

CommitSource <|.. GitHubCommitSource
CommitSource <|.. MockCommitSource
TaskSource <|.. FeishuTaskSource
TaskSource <|.. MockTaskSource
MessageSource <|.. FeishuMessageSource
MessageSource <|.. MockMessageSource
AttendanceSource <|.. FeishuAttendanceSource
AttendanceSource <|.. MockAttendanceSource

note right of AttendanceSource
  attendance_source 为可选字段：未配置时整段采集跳过，
  行为与 v1.1 变更前完全一致（ADR-005）。
end note

note bottom of SourceBundle
  编排层只依赖 SourceBundle 与端口，不认识具体数据源；
  Mock 实现与真实实现同契约，窗口过滤语义一致。
end note
@enduml
